# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# WUFPA website
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── PERSONAL DATA — NEVER COMMIT ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Pages 6-7 of the association profile are raster scans of the governance roster
# and carry the personal mobile telephone numbers of ~60 office-holders.
# Uganda Data Protection and Privacy Act, 2019 applies. A file committed once
# lives in git history permanently, so these are blocked at the repository level
# rather than left to reviewer vigilance.
#   See: docs/12_MEDIA_LIBRARY.md section 7
#        docs/11_TEAM_AND_LEADERSHIP.md section 6
src/assets/photos/_quarantine/
**/roster-scan-*
**/*roster*.png
**/*roster*.jpg

# The unredacted profile must never be served. public/originals/ is the client
# archive and IS committed; public/downloads/ serves the redacted edition only.
public/downloads/*unredacted*
public/downloads/WUFPA PROFILE 2026.pdf

# ── BUILD OUTPUT ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
dist/
.astro/
.output/
.vercel/
.netlify/

# ── DEPENDENCIES ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/

# ── ENVIRONMENT & SECRETS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── TOOLING ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.lighthouseci/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
.eslintcache

# ── OS & EDITOR ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

# ── LOGS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
